            "description": "**This is what a 502 needs.** A partial batch answers \"stored 3 of 40; batch_id X. Do NOT blind-retry\" \u2014 before this endpoint the only remedy was to email the admin. Now you count what landed and resend the rest.\n\nHosted this is a key condition on the GSI, not a filter."
