            "description": "The stored record, including what a manufacturer never sees: submitted_by (`brand-client:<client_id>`), brand_id, batch_id, the merged note (item note + batch note), expires_at null, and review_note explaining the auto-approval. `gear_brand` comes from the verified credential, not from anything the caller sent \u2014 attribution must not be assertable."
